Open the session repository in JetBrains Gateway from the composer.

Adds one muted Gateway icon-and-label link beside the Tailscale name on
desktop, hidden below the md breakpoint. The connection uses the runner's full
tailnet address, the session workspace, and the IntelliJ build injected by the
web image build. Gateway reuses or installs the selected IDE rather than
assuming a session-specific IDE path.
Applies after 0002-composer-tailscale-host.patch.
Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f).

